PostgreSQL migrations for the stay API.

Run commands from api/ with the virtual environment activated:

    alembic upgrade head
    alembic current
    alembic check

DATABASE_URL is read from the repository root .env or the environment.
Do not put credentials in alembic.ini.

The first migration enables pg_trgm for destination substring searches.
Its downgrade removes the stays table but leaves pg_trgm installed because
other tables in the same database may use it.
